WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.751 --> 00:00:15.312
boys were small and fast.

2
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:19.273
They lost the guards before they entered the pyramid.

3
00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:26.575
Inside, Vinnie followed Akhom through a long narrow passage that led to a chamber.

4
00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:30.876
Inside the chamber, Vinnie stopped and stared.

5
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.890
The walls were covered with paintings and symbols.

6
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.514
“Who is that body with a dog’s head?”

7
00:00:40.194 --> 00:00:42.036
Vinnie pointed to a painted figure.

8
00:00:42.056 --> 00:00:47.020
“That is Anubis, the guardian of the dead,” Akhom replied.

9
00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:53.346
“Pharaoh must prove to Anubis and the other gods that he has lived a good life.

10
00:00:54.127 --> 00:00:57.770
Only then will he be able to rest peacefully after he dies.”

11
00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:03.931
Akhom explained, “This is one of the false burial chambers that leads to another passage.

12
00:01:05.252 --> 00:01:07.734
You must pass several passages and chambers.

13
00:01:08.615 --> 00:01:12.538
Finally you come to the secret chamber filled with gold and jewels.

14
00:01:13.619 --> 00:01:16.602
The secret chamber is where the Pharaoh will be buried.”

15
00:01:16.622 --> 00:01:21.946
“But we can’t go there today,” said Vinnie anxiously.

16
00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.548
“We have to find my sister.”

17
00:01:25.449 --> 00:01:28.472
Akhom led Vinnie to the other side of the pyramid.

18
00:01:29.332 --> 00:01:33.993
When the boys left the pyramid, they saw a small boat pulling up to the shore.

19
00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:40.015
Several men leaped out, dragging a long papyrus rope toward the pyramid.

20
00:01:41.195 --> 00:01:43.516
Mandy was the only one left in the boat.

21
00:01:44.936 --> 00:01:46.937
She stood up to admire the pyramid.

22
00:01:46.957 --> 00:01:53.078
“Mandy!” Suddenly Mandy heard her brother’s voice.

23
00:01:54.119 --> 00:01:56.099
She looked for him on the crowded shore.

24
00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.341
Just then, the loud noise of horns began to sound.

25
00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.123
It came from the grandest ship in the river.

26
00:02:05.143 --> 00:02:07.244
“It’s the Pharaoh!”

27
00:02:07.725 --> 00:02:08.525
whispered Akhom.

28
00:02:09.426 --> 00:02:10.706
He fell to his knees.

29
00:02:11.867 --> 00:02:15.209
Everyone at the pyramid site stopped and fell to their knees.

30
00:02:16.229 --> 00:02:17.910
Only Vinnie remained standing.

31
00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:19.951
“Get on your knees!”

32
00:02:20.512 --> 00:02:21.352
Akhom whispered.

33
00:02:22.453 --> 00:02:25.014
But Vinnie wanted a good view of the Pharaoh.

34
00:02:27.395 --> 00:02:28.456
The Pharaoh appeared.

35
00:02:29.396 --> 00:02:33.038
He wore a blue and gold headdress and held a golden staff.

36
00:02:35.339 --> 00:02:36.959
Suddenly the Pharaoh stopped.

37
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.421
He stared at the one small standing figure.

38
00:02:42.341 --> 00:02:46.703
When the Pharaoh lifted his staff, three armed guards ran toward Vinnie.

39
00:02:47.323 --> 00:02:50.105
“Vinnie!” Mandy yelled.

40
00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:52.966
“Quickly, get into the boat!”

41
00:02:54.086 --> 00:02:57.888
The guards were close, but the boys managed to jump into the boat.

42
00:02:58.788 --> 00:03:00.529
Akhom and Vinnie grabbed the oars.

43
00:03:00.549 --> 00:03:03.871
“I’m so glad to see you!”

44
00:03:04.531 --> 00:03:05.292
Mandy cried.

45
00:03:05.312 --> 00:03:08.594
“Me too,” gasped Vinnie.

46
00:03:11.135 --> 00:03:14.657
As they paddled away, Mandy looked up at the pyramid again.

47
00:03:14.677 --> 00:03:18.879
“Do you think this is the pyramid in our picture?”

48
00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:20.080
she asked.

49
00:03:21.021 --> 00:03:22.701
Vinnie pulled out the photo.

50
00:03:23.422 --> 00:03:26.884
The pyramid now appeared in a glowing red light.

51
00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.341
“This must be it!”

52
00:03:30.922 --> 00:03:31.982
exclaimed Mandy.

53
00:03:32.002 --> 00:03:33.163
“And look!

54
00:03:33.603 --> 00:03:37.706
We’re in a boat too, just like the old man in the picture.”

55
00:03:37.726 --> 00:03:42.450
“But there is an eagle in this picture,” Vinnie pointed out.

56
00:03:43.891 --> 00:03:45.992
“That’s my name,” Akhom said.

57
00:03:46.012 --> 00:03:48.014
“Akhom means eagle.”

58
00:03:50.796 --> 00:03:53.318
Suddenly the sky turned very bright.

59
00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:56.500
The children were forced to shut their eyes.

60
00:03:57.324 --> 00:03:59.085
Akhom’s voice began to fade.

61
00:03:59.105 --> 00:04:01.166
“We're going home.

62
00:04:01.506 --> 00:04:03.727
Good-bye, Akhom!”

63
00:04:03.787 --> 00:04:04.647
Mandy shouted.

64
00:04:05.628 --> 00:04:08.609
Vinnie and Mandy fell into a dark tunnel once again.

65
00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.971
Then with a loud thump, the children fell onto the hard attic floor.

66
00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:19.533
Opening his eyes, Vinnie cried, “We’re back home!”

67
00:04:19.553 --> 00:04:21.914
“Vinnie! Mandy!

68
00:04:22.254 --> 00:04:23.235
Time for lunch.”

69
00:04:24.135 --> 00:04:25.756
They heard their mother calling them.

70
00:04:28.104 --> 00:04:30.068
They stared at each other in confusion.

71
00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:32.392
Mandy looked at her watch.

72
00:04:33.695 --> 00:04:38.363
It was almost twelve noon, the exact time they had left for Egypt.
